# Optional runtime override of DC endpoints (IP/port only, NOT the RSA key).
# Place this file next to Telegram.exe. Format:
#   dcId host port [tcpo_only] [media_only]
# Anything after '#' is a comment. All DC ids are mapped to the same server,
# because the custom server hosts every DC on one host.

